 ## Background
-The position-normal tree was introduced by Bala et al. [S1], building on earlier work by Snyder [S1] and Walter et al. [S1]. It is used in the context of single scattering in refractive media with triangle mesh boundaries to efficiently compute refractive connection paths [S1].
